#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:4
msgid "# Menu Bar Overview"
msgstr "# Übersicht über die Menüleiste"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:6
msgid "## Game menu"
msgstr "## Spiel-Menü"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **New Game** – Starts a new game. If a previous game is still running, you\n"
"will asked for confirmation to stop that game.\n"
msgstr ""
"* **Neues Spiel** – Startet ein neues Spiel. Falls ein vorheriges Spiel noch l"
"äuft, werden Sie um Bestätigung gebeten, um dieses Spiel zu beenden.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **New Roll** – Starts a new game in the same mode as the currently running\n"
"one. Again, you will asked for confirmation to stop that game.\n"
msgstr ""
"* **Neu würfeln** – Startet ein neues Spiel im selben Modus wie das aktuell la"
"ufende. Auch hier werden Sie um eine Bestätigung zum Beenden des aktuellen Spi"
"els gebeten.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **Choose…** – Lets you start a game which has been saved previously. A file"
"\n"
"chooser dialog will be opened where you can search for the desired game file."
"\n"
msgstr ""
"* **Importieren…** – Hiermit können Sie ein zuvor gespeichertes Spiel starten."
" Es öffnet sich ein Dateiauswahldialog, in dem Sie die gewünschte Spieldatei a"
"uswählen können.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **Share…** – Lets you save the game in a file. A file chooser dialog will be"
"\n"
"opened where you can choose for a file name and directory. Although it is\n"
"possible, keep the **File type** entry unchanged. We don't recommend to save\n"
"files with another extension than `.tanglet`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: ../menubar.md:22
msgid ""
"**End** – End the game. You will asked for confirmation to stop the game."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **Pause** – Pause the game. Probably you need this for time-limited games.\n"
"When pausing a game, the whole window content disappears. After clicking\n"
"anywhere in the window, the pause ends and the content comes back. Note, also"
"\n"
"when the window losts the focus, the window content disappears.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **Details** – Shows details about the running game, such as the board size,"
"\n"
"the word density and length, the game type and a short description of that gam"
"e.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **High Scores** – Shows the High Scores. The initial view shows the High\n"
"Scores for the type of the currently running game. To view the High Scores\n"
"for the other game types, click on the vertical tab bar on the left.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: ../menubar.md:36
msgid "**Quit** – Quits the game and the application."
msgstr "**Beenden** – Beendet das Spiel und die Anwendung."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:38
msgid "## Settings menu"
msgstr "## Einstellungen-Menü"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:41
msgid ""
"See [Configuration](./configuration.md) about how to use the entries of the "
"**Settings** menu."
msgstr ""
"Auf der Seite [Konfiguration](./configuration.md) finden Sie Informationen "
"darüber, wie Sie die Einträge im **Einstellungen**-Menü verwenden."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:43
msgid "## Help menu"
msgstr "## Hilfe-Menü"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **Controls** – Shows a brief summary of the usage. In fact, the same as\n"
"described in the [How to Play](./howtoplay.md) page.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **User manual** – Opens this user manual in your configured standard browser"
".\n"
"The opened application is out of the scope of **Tanglet**; if you like to use "
"a\n"
"different browser or HTML viewer, you need to configure this in the settings o"
"f\n"
"your desktop environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"* **Benutzerhandbuch** – Öffnet dieses Benutzerhandbuch in Ihrem konfigurierte"
"n\n"
"Standardbrowser. Die zu öffnende Anwendung gehört nicht zum **Tanglet**-Bereic"
"h;\n"
"wenn Sie einen anderen Browser oder HTML-Betrachter verwenden möchten, müssen "
"Sie\n"
"dies in den Einstellungen Ihrer Desktop-Umgebung konfigurieren.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: ../menubar.md:53
msgid ""
"**About** – Shows a brief summary, including the version number of "
"**Tanglet**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../menubar.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **About Qt** – Shows a description of [Qt](https://www.qt.io/), which is the"
"\n"
"code base of **Tanglet**.\n"
msgstr ""
"* **Über Qt** – Zeigt eine Beschreibung von [Qt](https://www.qt.io/), welches "
"die\n"
"Codebasis von **Tanglet** ist.\n"

